# inc-06ndv, for tools/check_chasm_swap.sh. INCURSION_CHASM_SWAP_PROBE=1 stages
# the scene before the first key: a levitating player on a chasm square, a
# walking ally one square east. RIGHT walks into the ally, which swaps places
# and pushes the ally onto the chasm square, where it falls.
# The probe's region description box takes the first key.
ESC
RIGHT
@dump:after-swap
SPACE*2
v
@dump:messages
@while "Messages" ESC
@quit
